  "sourceItems": [
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-01",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 0,
      "sourceHash": "dc0b619ce70cf902b5596d3e24fa42d7246c45b1d8e9e85908ceffc4ea5548ec",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-0"
      ],
      "text": "原子工作台：一屏多任务与底层重构。新增原子工作台超强多任务体验，支持左右、上下两种灵活布局与一键快速切换，随心搭建工作、学习、旅行专属工作台；底层首发自研多级依赖调度算法、重载内存融合模型与多窗渲染架构，保障重载多任务流畅稳定。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-02",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 1,
      "sourceHash": "ff232e373399ae65f109af8125447614236ee9cbb739a9de8165476671161773",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-1"
      ],
      "text": "小V灵动组件：一句话专属定制桌面组件。新增小V灵动组件功能，用户只需一句话描述即可创造个性化专属桌面组件，如倒数日、待办与工作状态卡片，简单直观又好用。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-03",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 2,
      "sourceHash": "3ef4325655f7ee0ae7da05dd60873a174cb78433018b131ec73d08367552cb23",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-2"
      ],
      "text": "蓝心小V：小V拍照问与视频问。新增小V拍照问与视频问能力，拍个照即可解答问题并智能推荐相关服务；视频问充当随行导游，基于实时摄像头画面深度理解并支持拟人化连续对话回应。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-04",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 3,
      "sourceHash": "75365d68b8c455ddccddea69f1c8692195872c87c1a9ede31257d71b1bc32a0d",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-3"
      ],
      "text": "AI系统能力：AI截屏直达与卡包归拢。新增AI截屏直达，截图智能识别并存入卡包，券码自动收纳并在屏幕左滑时快速调出，到期前主动弹出提醒。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-05",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 4,
      "sourceHash": "fb0147d01877031af7c9842debdfe5c564bccd7ec7daed3b2b69d49e9f83ccc9",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-4"
      ],
      "text": "相册：相册随手清。新增相册随手清功能，支持像刷短视频一样流式整理相册，AI自动分析相似图片留下最佳瞬间，上滑即可标记删除。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-06",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 5,
      "sourceHash": "f4f1743205df3fbd2ac777e2a65a27b438272ebabe627c4716359afa2fa86ede",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-5"
      ],
      "text": "文件管理：AI文件管家专题空间。新增AI文件管家，文件按主题智能归拢至专题空间，问一句自然语言即可快速定位文件内容并给出总结答案。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-07",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 6,
      "sourceHash": "2f5ca4da062db3aad04981560943b2946b226ff1b3ec63d07212b0e8cfcb2e3e",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-6"
      ],
      "text": "输入法：vivo输入法AI信息检索。新增vivo输入法AI信息检索能力，聊天时输入关键词即可快速查找并发送文档、日程和联系人，遇到疑问可即时搜索解答。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-08",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 7,
      "sourceHash": "4e10c19daf7a0ab232c2edb6cab6de387946cb3399a3342d5c762b83b6525f49",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-7"
      ],
      "text": "原子笔记：第三方智能体与CLI接入。新增原子笔记第三方智能体与命令行工具（CLI）数据读写授权能力，支持端侧AI助手接入笔记进行信息整理与结构化总结。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-09",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 8,
      "sourceHash": "c6d6ade1bd58343d8266535d5fa84bdc361385f05112819aad718a51cadd4809",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-8"
      ],
      "text": "日历：AI日历与待办深度整合。新增AI日历今日备忘与待办安排，智能提炼日程重点与待办任务摘要；原原子笔记待办全面整合至日历应用中统一管理。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-10",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 9,
      "sourceHash": "92a223f5c745b0a457aa747573480f25e693674b6f5f404eb4dc2ee121789716",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-9"
      ],
      "text": "小V记忆与录音：小V记忆卡与AI录音脉络。新增小V记忆卡，锁屏状态下说段话、拍张照或圈选屏幕即可生成记忆卡；AI录音机新增进度条重点提炼、大纲观点识别与文本清洗整理。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-highlight-11",
      "classification": "highlight",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 10,
      "sourceHash": "7e729e75ba95736b62ab88a367677afb11139e4147772c587fa5d2df4d1c171f",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-10"
      ],
      "text": "健康：健康减脂点数管理。新增健康减脂功能，将每日摄入量与运动预算点数化直观呈现，每周自动输出AI健康报告，清晰量化身体改变。",
      "targetIds": [
        "highlight-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-01",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 11,
      "sourceHash": "23e046ae613c73423efd507b13cd3e80afcc0cbe6e76df107d90034242f13c4f",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-11"
      ],
      "text": "系统：新增 模块原子化能力，支持蓝心小V、全搜、锁屏等多入口快捷调用。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-02",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 12,
      "sourceHash": "4038dfec70d3a4b725d7e6596a2eafd40091e7ae54d75d33346c27c7ec0d5a58",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-12"
      ],
      "text": "系统：优化 系统 AI 光影效果，统一状态表达，让 AI 新功能呈现一致、自然的光影反馈。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-03",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 13,
      "sourceHash": "b4382ef11b37567d15b55d87b85805d04782ed4cd78969cedcf3c73a07e38892",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-13"
      ],
      "text": "锁屏：新增 多款锁屏个性时钟样式。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-04",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 14,
      "sourceHash": "ff315dfc7c7d043ee290df10aa28507a505210f08247ec994a89d93506eb5378",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-14"
      ],
      "text": "锁屏：新增 部分个性时钟字体，支持字重与大小调节能力。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-05",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 15,
      "sourceHash": "4051dc7e83611e59a92f90a5b9f983c085970b57327da0d8c4699ed8a39c1b86",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-15"
      ],
      "text": "锁屏：新增 锁屏长按手势，支持长按进入“锁屏编辑”，便捷管理“我的搭配”。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-06",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 16,
      "sourceHash": "ab87ade524301a01563b02a76cbbc00cf1606d815efa6597a2edac1350088701",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-16"
      ],
      "text": "蓝河流畅引擎：新增 在部分第三方应用预约购买界面支持小V圈搜创建秒抢日程，临抢时自动开启秒抢引擎。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-07",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 17,
      "sourceHash": "1bd59ee4b0c9bc6274bcf6c4005cad584d553b71c2126fabd375b12a7febfcb2",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-17"
      ],
      "text": "状态栏：优化 敏感权限调用提醒，使用定位、麦克风、相机时，状态栏会立刻显示图标或彩色小点提醒。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-08",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 18,
      "sourceHash": "1ed0a081d59e6be37aa19ccc59980af39faf6241344abbc5e9635d32be5d43f8",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-18"
      ],
      "text": "原子动效 7.0：优化 一镜到底的效果体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-09",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 19,
      "sourceHash": "f0a0ea2dbda08e0c8465916b9e86aa283d6f8392975d361a3ee76e984c28792e",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-19"
      ],
      "text": "连接中心：优化 连接中心组件内的设备显示，支持 1×1、1×2、1×4、2×2 多种卡片尺寸。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-10",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 20,
      "sourceHash": "e878422eccc96e0a18815fd41228ab7bda096b2c0e6d67fd5739e59c60d5addb",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-20"
      ],
      "text": "日历：新增 待办功能，原“原子笔记”待办已整合至「日历」应用，并优化待办创建、管理和查看体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-11",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 21,
      "sourceHash": "af384a97f2f002fae19c87747895aa39803856e74d47377bd26977bfdca6fd27",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-21"
      ],
      "text": "日历：优化 日历视图展示，日程与待办信息呈现更清晰。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-12",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 22,
      "sourceHash": "c95bc7379416b2926c994072a68ab6053e43098fa140917f58b7dd26d7de698d",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-22"
      ],
      "text": "录音机：新增 文本整理功能，支持转写完成后自动进行文本清洗与结构优化，使内容更清晰、直接可用。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-13",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 23,
      "sourceHash": "b5eef78e111e4d02f1b1584c22c1b370c54b6b80f0c73ef34da38f070e8b4af0",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-23"
      ],
      "text": "录音机：新增 待办导入功能，支持识别 AI 总结中的待办事项，并一键导入系统日程待办。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-14",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 24,
      "sourceHash": "75b81eb7d188cd5a550c7a23d8e55fef92441141f7060944e1b8cdbdac9f8e65",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-24"
      ],
      "text": "蓝海续航系统：新增 超轻图形框架，增强应用启动退出、下拉通知中心和控制中心等场景的帧率调度利用率，提升系统的续航表现。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-15",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 25,
      "sourceHash": "ced7035819699a49e0293afe001b5a32ab32cd40fb8c2e765d6349acb6951ff0",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-25"
      ],
      "text": "蓝海续航系统：升级 系统轻量化，深度优化后台应用网络耗电和熄屏下的省电策略，提升系统的续航表现。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-16",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 26,
      "sourceHash": "736ffa578602156fc9730248f24723c1abf3b3644119b0ad4385f367e9856123",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-26"
      ],
      "text": "桌面：新增 深色图标，在深色模式下使用更舒适，视觉更协调，您可前往“设置”＞“显示、亮度与护眼”＞“深色模式设置”＞“图标效果”中设置。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-17",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 27,
      "sourceHash": "e2b80f74f00e3246b70814e0e74964b0ea42de959bd574f747d855ea7ea685d1",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-27"
      ],
      "text": "桌面：优化 行为图标设计，呈现更生动、更有质感的使用体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-18",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 28,
      "sourceHash": "02ec2b4edcb6e5e8f18e383c3a19beb04ba4f85ccc0aed833fac3e0d82f984e6",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-28"
      ],
      "text": "桌面：优化 系统默认图标，从图形、色彩维度全面升级，提升桌面视觉体验。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-19",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 29,
      "sourceHash": "2fc2707c47e83b022801a570fdd1fdf470bf4fb7f09259843738ad28fba747c1",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-29"
      ],
      "text": "通知中心：新增 通知临时静默功能，可左滑通知后进入设置，选择临时静默该应用通知 1 小时或 1 天。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-20",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 30,
      "sourceHash": "b50d4552b60b6e4cefd72c174a44d4909b3327a5158e6960c6e9acac8e55fc14",
      "blockIds": [
        "block-30"
      ],
      "text": "通知中心：新增 通知分组一键清除功能，通知整理更便捷。",
      "targetIds": [
        "update-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "source-update-21",
      "classification": "update",
      "source": "更多_OriginOS_7_体验亮点.html",
      "sourceIndex": 31,
      "sourceHash": "18be82876c3c61325275c942bf07f639cd0ab6624ab7deb2a0fee72f55b6c3d9",
      "blockIds": [
